# Hover consistency

## Toolbar (Import pack, Step by step, To do list, Guide)

Match **folder box cards** (`.lp-click-folder-box`):

- Single row: `flex-wrap: nowrap`, compact horizontal padding (`0 7px`)
- Text/icon color: `#7A818B` default → `#fff` on hover
- Icons turn white on hover via `filter: brightness(0) invert(1)`

## Panel actions (New, Run, Open)

Use `.workspace-action-btn` — mint text + light green background on hover.

## Completed (to-do dashboard)

Label **Completed** with `completed.svg`. Always confirm before delete:
`lazyTodos.completedConfirm`
